01:51:57.933 --> 01:52:02.533
Kenapa sih, gue
harus nurut sama guru?

01:52:03.566 --> 01:52:06.000
Dengarkan baik-baik
apa kata guru.

01:52:09.066 --> 01:52:10.133
Kelihatan capek.

01:52:10.400 --> 01:52:12.300
Sensei, muka lu lucu banget.

01:52:14.200 --> 01:52:14.833
Tunggu, tunggu.

01:52:15.033 --> 01:52:16.033
Apa?

01:52:16.333 --> 01:52:17.333
Kuberi tahu ya.

01:52:17.500 --> 01:52:18.500
Ada yang mau keluar nih.

01:52:19.133 --> 01:52:20.433
Udah disajiin duluan padahal.

01:52:24.300 --> 01:52:48.566
Udah disajikan. Eh,
matanya ketebelan nggak sih?

01:52:49.800 --> 01:52:53.266
Sebentar. Tapi,
cocok kan buat aku?

01:52:54.100 --> 01:52:59.000
