01:58:43.100 --> 01:58:44.133
Nggak, sebentar, eh, biarin deh.

01:58:44.500 --> 01:58:48.000
Eh, Pin-chan, coba hangatkan
sebentar juga. Hm, selamat makan.

01:58:48.300 --> 01:58:49.300
