dimakan, jadi ya gitu. Hah?

01:59:10.966 --> 01:59:13.066
Ya. Boleh.

01:59:13.800 --> 01:59:14.800
Sedang makan.

01:59:14.933 --> 01:59:15.933
Ya.

01:59:16.500 --> 01:59:17.733
